{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 GET INVOLVED IN PRE-RELEASE \u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TransmuTowers</strong> is our indie studio\u2019s passion project of 2 years. We\u2019re excited to meet others who love tower defense and bullet heaven games just as much as we do. Join our Discord for early access and many memes. If you <strong>provide a lot of quality feedback</strong>, we\u2019ll even put you in the hall of fame on release!\u00a0\u265a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 ADVENTURE THROUGH THE CAMPAIGN\u00a0\u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king of Valber has debilitating anxiety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His queen bullies him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They both have no idea what they\u2019re doing when the kingdom gets into a crisis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s why they need YOU! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your alchemist, and venture into the 5 lands of Valber.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your foothold, and gather resources to better defend and fortify your position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can survive, you just might save the kingdom and uncover its dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features <strong>15-20 minutes</strong> of gameplay against hordes of magical monsters, all lovingly hand drawn and animated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Paper Mario</i>\u2019s aesthetic, enjoy scenic locations that blend 2D and 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>dozens of towers</strong> and <strong>over a hundred upgrades and effects</strong>, devise new strategies to experiment and optimize. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your augments wisely each run, and climb the roguelike meta-progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 CORE GAME FEATURES \u2726</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Single Player and Online Co-Op (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and adapt in &quot;Tower Defense x Survival x Bullet Heaven&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the campaign to meet and unlock new alchemists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy refreshing gameplay each run with roguelike meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore gorgeous worlds, combining hand-drawn and animated 2D and immersive 3D styles</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814360?t=1773052909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773052909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/ee73d370b358230e04a32779bf2224a55c27e2a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773052909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/ee73d370b358230e04a32779bf2224a55c27e2a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773052909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4096200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 GET INVOLVED IN PRE-RELEASE \u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TransmuTowers</strong> is our indie studio\u2019s passion project of 2 years. We\u2019re excited to meet others who love tower defense and bullet heaven games just as much as we do. Join our Discord for early access and many memes. If you <strong>provide a lot of quality feedback</strong>, we\u2019ll even put you in the hall of fame on release!\u00a0\u265a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 ADVENTURE THROUGH THE CAMPAIGN\u00a0\u2726</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king of Valber has debilitating anxiety. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His queen bullies him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They both have no idea what they\u2019re doing when the kingdom gets into a crisis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that\u2019s why they need YOU! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b6f9715a997cfa519bc76ba6911cb60c.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your alchemist, and venture into the 5 lands of Valber.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your foothold, and gather resources to better defend and fortify your position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can survive, you just might save the kingdom and uncover its dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/354b1cf65e100c65f2e1cd6abd2a7b55.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features <strong>15-20 minutes</strong> of gameplay against hordes of magical monsters, all lovingly hand drawn and animated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Paper Mario</i>\u2019s aesthetic, enjoy scenic locations that blend 2D and 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/2661d31a19ae40749f491037de558613.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>dozens of towers</strong> and <strong>over a hundred upgrades and effects</strong>, devise new strategies to experiment and optimize. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your augments wisely each run, and climb the roguelike meta-progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.poster.avif?t=1773052909\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.webm?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/extras/b932045b7ef19240d4f15771ec737f6f.mp4?t=1773052909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2726 CORE GAME FEATURES \u2726</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Single Player and Online Co-Op (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize and adapt in &quot;Tower Defense x Survival x Bullet Heaven&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the campaign to meet and unlock new alchemists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy refreshing gameplay each run with roguelike meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore gorgeous worlds, combining hand-drawn and animated 2D and immersive 3D styles</p></li></ul>","developers":["Edenic Era LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814360/42211c7b4bf6d314dcf3f91467eb72a4d600eb3b/header.jpg?t=1773052909","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla